\id GEN SAGE bounded stage evidence packet
\c 3
\v 24 After he drove the man out, he placed on the east side\f + \fr 3:24 \ft Or \fq placed \fqa in front\f* of the Garden of Eden cherubim and a flaming sword flashing back and forth to guard the way to the tree of life.
\c 6
\v 9 This is the account of Noah and his family.
\p Noah was a righteous man, blameless among the people of his time, and he walked faithfully with God.
